"# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Linux kernel sysctls: process limits, key quotas, panics, console
# Generated 2026-01-01 by linux-tuners.dev/kernel
# System: Container host or Kubernetes node, 16 GiB RAM, systemd 243 or newer
